OL,3,GNEWSAUB40 to appear at Ludlow Castle
OL,4,Anext summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FUB40 have been added to the list of
OL,7,Facts due to perform at Ludlow Castle in
OL,8,F2027.
OL,10,FThe reggae band, including their lead
OL,11,Fsinger and co-founder, Ali Campbell,
OL,12,Fwill appear on 18 July.
OL,14,FThe Live at Ludlow concerts, which
OL,15,Fstarted in 2023 will also feature McFly
OL,16,Fand Becky Hill, with more names due to
OL,17,Fbe announced in the coming weeks.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
