OL,3,GNEWSAUB40 to appear at Ludlow Castle
OL,4,Anext summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis summer 50,000 people visited over
OL,7,Ftwo weekends, to see artists including
OL,8,FSnow Patrol, Paul Weller, The Human
OL,9,FLeague, Tom Grennan, The Streets, Rick
OL,10,FAstley, Richard Ashcroft and Scissor
OL,11,FSisters.
